::MODULE{FIELDS|title:Only verified offer fields}
title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at

::RULE{Parse only official public pages; obey robots.txt and skip inaccessible sources}
::RULE{Offer data requires an official structured Offer with a plan name and price; omit ambiguous, renewal, crossed-out, and expired prices}
::RULE{Never infer a coupon, discount, commission, or expiry}
::BOUNDARY{never:invent offers prices discounts commissions|scope:permanent}
::STATE{@UPDATE,frequency:6h,affiliate_links:empty until approved and supplied}
